    {
      "source": "Return the <a href=\"AutoConfigurationImportSelector.AutoConfigurationEntry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>AutoConfigurationImportSelector.AutoConfigurationEntry</code></a> based on the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/AnnotationMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type\"><code>AnnotationMetadata</code></a>\nof the importing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "返回基于导入的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a> 类的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/AnnotationMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type\"><code>AnnotationMetadata</code></a> 的 <a href=\"AutoConfigurationImportSelector.AutoConfigurationEntry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>AutoConfigurationImportSelector.AutoConfigurationEntry</code></a>。",
