      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the source annotation class used by the selector.",
      "translation": "返回选择器使用的源注解类。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return any exclusions that limit the candidate configurations.",
      "translation": "返回任何限制候选配置的排除项。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle any invalid excludes that have been specified.",
      "translation": "处理任何已指定的无效排除项。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/DeferredImportSelector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>DeferredImportSelector</code></a> to handle <a href=\"EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>auto-configuration</code></a>. This class can also be subclassed if a custom variant of\n<a href=\"EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>@EnableAutoConfiguration</code></a> is needed.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/DeferredImportSelector.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>DeferredImportSelector</code></a> 用于处理 <a href=\"EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>auto-configuration</code></a>。如果需要自定义的 <a href=\"EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>@EnableAutoConfiguration</code></a> 变体，也可以对该类进行子类化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the appropriate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/AnnotationAttributes.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>AnnotationAttributes</code></a> from the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/AnnotationMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type\"><code>AnnotationMetadata</code></a>. By default this method will return attributes for\n<a href=\"#getAnnotationClass()\"><code>getAnnotationClass()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/AnnotationMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type\"><code>AnnotationMetadata</code></a> 返回适当的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/AnnotationAttributes.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>AnnotationAttributes</code></a>。默认情况下，此方法将返回 <a href=\"#getAnnotationClass()\"><code>getAnnotationClass()</code></a> 的属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the auto-configuration class names that should be considered. By default,\nthis method will load candidates using <a href=\"../context/annotation/ImportCandidates.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.context.annotation\"><code>ImportCandidates</code></a>.",
